  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 103.13 “Functional and intact” means that a structure is in its original shape, is structurally sound, and can be used for its originally intended purpose.\n\nSource. #13945, eff 4-24-24 (see Revision Note #5 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 100)",
